      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc62T4vo",
      "title": "docs: add SuperchainDefinition type to superchain-config spec",
      "author": "Himess",
      "number": 867,
      "body": "**Description**\r\nAdds `SuperchainDefinition` type documentation to superchain-config spec with field descriptions for L1 contract addresses and network parameters.\r\nFixes #741 \r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\n\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
      "createdAt": "2025-12-01T10:28:03Z",
